  "results": [
    "The explicit real quadratic KS map is smooth and onto, with norm identity |K(y)|=|y|^2, exact first and second Frechet derivatives, row orthogonality and vanishing Laplacian.",
    "For every globally C2 target function into a real normed space, the actual Laplacian of its KS composition equals 4|y|^2 times the target Laplacian. This statement has its explicit C2 hypothesis.",
    "For every actual scalar H2 Coulomb eigenfunction, its proved locally Lipschitz representative has a globally bounded, locally Lipschitz nuclear KS pullback retaining every spectator coordinate. The actual pullback is L2 on each compact lifted set.",
    "The selected lifted singular set has product Lebesgue measure zero. The exact transverse ball volume is pi^2 r^4/2 for r>=0; finite-spectator tube squared L2 mass has the corresponding bound and tends to zero.",
    "Actual smooth hole cutoffs vanish on the inner ball and equal one outside twice the radius. Their coordinate derivative bounds are C1/delta and C2/delta^2 for finite nonnegative existential constants."
  ],
